+HEAD is now at beec6f4\&.\&.\&. Make ReflectorImpl use mailboxes
+\fB$ git map\-branches\fR
+\fBorigin/master
+\fR  cool_feature
+    subfeature
+  fixit
+    frozen_branch
+.fi
+.if n \{\
+.RE
+.\}
